{"script":"Main_1_03_3","des":"掌炉者库尔斯","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show]你们是……荒野客？这个工房里可没有能够施舍给你们的东西！[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":0,"y":-146,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara010_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":0,"y":-146,"transTime":300,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara010_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"莉拉","text":"[show]掌炉者，不要被眼前的麻烦遮住了双眼，在开口之前不妨多看看四周。[r][l]这两位可不是什么普通的荒野客，而是我特意请来的契约保镖。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":0,"y":-146,"transTime":300,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara010_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show]……原来是莉拉首座，没想到您居然屈尊亲自到来了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":0,"y":-146,"transTime":300,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara010_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"莉拉","text":"[show]因为我预定的“小玩意”就是有这么重要啊！[r][l]不过我看您的脸色，似乎我们的契约无法按时完成了？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":0,"y":-146,"transTime":300,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara010_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show]是啊，没错！不过这都是因为不可抗力，即使按照条款，我们也绝对不构成违约。[r][l]就算去找菲尔德蕾公证，我也不会赔给环会一个铜子！[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":0,"y":-146,"transTime":300,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara010_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"莉拉","text":"[show]哈，环会在意的可不是那些没意义的贵金属。[r][l]我只想知道，究竟是什么不可抗力，让我的订单无法如期完成。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":0,"y":-146,"transTime":300,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara010_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show]哦！感谢您的好心，看来您不是听到风声来索赔的！那我就给您透个底吧——[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show][size=%75]我们遇到了一些……原材料上的麻烦。[r][l]其实不止是您的订单难以交付，就连整个中央锻炉都有覆灭的风险！[sizeEnd][l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_21"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":0,"y":-146,"transTime":300,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara010_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":50,"y":-264.80000000000007,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":50,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":300,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]那到底是什么麻烦？这不还是没有说清楚吗？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"l